    {
      "name": "places/ChIJExQ7NI_0aS4R5FlBnGjqEjU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNPb2Etb093EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "It has been a long time since I haven't visited this neighborhood. It turned out that there's a cafe and restaurant here. Good place to hang out with family and friends or just to have a me time. Quite a cozy place with good food and beverages. They have a lot of variations for food, beverages and also snacks (light meals) to be enjoyed with your coffee.\nPrice: $$-$$$ (affordable)\nComfort: 4/5\nHospitality: 4/5\nMenu options: 4.5/5\nTaste: 3.5/5 (some beverages wasn't good enough).",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
