      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "Hidden coffee shop, they provide various  beverages & food, even healthy meal.\nThere is this indoor area on the first floor while the semi outdoor area on the second floor.\nSince people usually book this cafe for wedding, better contact them before visit.",
