    {
      "name": "places/ChIJExQ7NI_0aS4R5FlBnGjqEjU/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURvbzhqVkd3EAE",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 years ago",
      "rating": 3,
      "text": {
        "text": "*incomplete review\n\nA relatively new spot, probably only locals around would know this place.\n\npretty good spot for quick hangout in the area and for small meetups, by all definitions this is a typical cafe and the coffe is prettt decent but they also offer run-of-the-mill street food which i haven't tried yet and can't rate.. i guess it's good option when you want a street dinner in cozier setting\n\nTried the charcoal latte and coffe both are good, the thick toast is reasonably cheap but the wafer is damp\n\nExpect mosquitos around you and outdoor settings with street noise and humidity",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
