      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 years ago",
      "rating": 4,
      "text": {
        "text": "This is a nice little place in a residential area in East Jakarta. I had a few snacks here i.e. fried tofu & fried banana with milk and cheese. They're good especially the banana which was not too sweet.\n\nI like the decoration of the place. It's clean and there is ample parking space. It'll be nice to come here again.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
